{
  "chapters": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "type": "book_title_announcement",
          "text": "The Gambler, by Fyodor Dostoyevsky.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 1,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "type": "chapter_announcement",
          "text": "Chapter One.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 2,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "At length I returned from two weeks leave of absence to find that my patrons had arrived three days ago in Roulettenberg.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 3,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I received from them a welcome quite different to that which I had expected.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 4,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The General eyed me coldly, greeted me in rather haughty fashion, and dismissed me to pay my respects to his sister.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 5,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I was assigned a small room on the fourth floor of the hotel, for you must know that I belonged to the General's suite.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 6,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Finally his anger exploded, and he added sharply:",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 7,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "I suppose you would like to take them to the Casino to play roulette? Well, excuse my speaking so plainly, but I know how addicted you are to gambling.",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 8,
          "emotion": "sharp anger"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "I have no money for gambling.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 9,
          "emotion": "quiet"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I quietly replied.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 9,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "But you will soon be in receipt of some.",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 10,
          "emotion": "retorting"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Retorted the General.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 10,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Let us calculate.",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 11,
          "emotion": "brisk"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "He went on.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 11,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "We must translate these roubles into thalers. Here, take 100 thalers, as a round sum. The rest will be safe in my hands.",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 11,
          "emotion": "commanding"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I accepted the money without a word, and then withdrew to my own room.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 12,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "On the way I met Polina Alexandrovna on the staircase.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 13,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "I have been waiting for you.",
          "char_id": 3,
          "sec_id": 14,
          "emotion": "quiet anticipation"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "She said.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 14,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Come to my room.",
          "char_id": 3,
          "sec_id": 14,
          "emotion": "soft command"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I followed her in silence.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 15,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "type": "chapter_announcement",
          "text": "Chapter Six.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 1,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I stepped from the path into the carriage-way, and took my stand in the middle of it. There I awaited the Baron and the Baroness.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 2,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "When they were but a few paces distant from me I took off my hat, and bowed.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 3,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Madame la Baronne.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 4,
          "emotion": "loud, mock-courteous"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Said I, loudly and distinctly.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 4,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "J'ai l'honneur d'être votre esclave.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 4,
          "emotion": "loud, mock-courteous"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Hein!",
          "char_id": 4,
          "sec_id": 5,
          "emotion": "angry growl"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Ejaculated, or rather growled, the Baron as he turned towards me in angry surprise.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 5,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Ja wohl!",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 6,
          "emotion": "defiant"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I replied, still looking him in the eyes.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 6,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Sind Sie rasend?",
          "char_id": 4,
          "sec_id": 7,
          "emotion": "alarmed fury"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "He exclaimed, brandishing his stick.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 7,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "I have perpetrated the piece of idiocy.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 8,
          "emotion": "flat confession"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I said as I came level with her.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 8,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Have you? Then you can take the consequences.",
          "char_id": 3,
          "sec_id": 9,
          "emotion": "cold dismissal"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "She replied without so much as looking at me.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 9,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "My good sir.",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 10,
          "emotion": "icy formality"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The General began.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 10,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "May I ask you what this is that you have gone and done?",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 10,
          "emotion": "icy formality"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "I should be glad.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 11,
          "emotion": "calm"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I replied.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 11,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "If we could come straight to the point. Probably you are referring to my encounter of today with a German?",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 11,
          "emotion": "calm"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "With a German? Why, the German was the Baron Burmergelm, a most important personage! I hear that you have been rude both to him and to the Baroness?",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 12,
          "emotion": "incredulous outrage"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "No, I have not.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 13,
          "emotion": "flat"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I replied.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 13,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "For God's sake, Alexis Ivanovitch, do put an end to this senseless scheme of yours!",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 14,
          "emotion": "pleading"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "He muttered, but with a sudden change from a truculent tone to one of entreaty as he caught me by the hand.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 14,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "With that he wound up in a despairing voice.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 15,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "O Alexis Ivanovitch, Alexis Ivanovitch!",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 15,
          "emotion": "despairing"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
